                <p>The responsibility and liability of the Bank Director is ever increasing. It is critical your Directors stay current with the training to help them through the complexities of today's banking environment.</p>

                <p><strong>The Directors Education Series&trade;</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>is a Library of training modules focused on the role and expectations of the Bank Director's conduct, duties and liabilities. Our programs have been authored by a group of highly recognized, respected industry experts. Your subscription to this series will assist you with the responsibility you have to educate those who serve on your Board.</p>

                <p>One annual subscription provides your financial institution access to&nbsp;our entire module library with a new module published each month. Features of the&nbsp;<strong>The Directors Education Series&trade;</strong>&nbsp;include:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>20-25 minutes in length (<strong>Perfect for Board Meetings</strong>)</li>
                    <li>Audio, Video &amp; PowerPoint</li>
                    <li>Handouts and Discussion Questions</li>
                    <li>Course Tracking</li>
                    <li>Accessible on a variety of devices (Tablets, Mobile Devices, Laptops, etc.)</li>
                    <li>Certificates of Completion</li>
                    <li>And More!</li>
                </ul>
